WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.417
The copper tooth fits into the blue drive disc.

00:00:01.417 --> 00:00:02.625
Only the front drive disc turns.

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:03.750
The lug now pushes against the carrier stop.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.000
The brass housing presses the sidebar against the rear disc.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.542
The silver tip starts its turn.

00:00:05.542 --> 00:00:06.542
The inner pick turns the first gated disc easily.

00:00:06.542 --> 00:00:07.250
The middle disc also turns easily.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.167
The tip reaches the rear disc, which carries the load from the sidebar.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:10.708
The rear gate gives the sidebar room to move. The middle rim now supports it.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:12.917
The front rim still holds the sidebar in the housing.

00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:16.458
The last gate lines up. The sidebar clears the housing.

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:17.000
The seated sidebar and all three discs turn with the carrier.
